Requirement Analysis Conclusion
EduGenie requires an AI-powered, secure, user-friendly, and scalable learning platform that integrates Google Gemini to provide conversational tutoring, personalized explanations, study-material processing, quiz generation, study planning, and learning-progress support. The initial MVP should focus on the core Learn–Practice–Evaluate cycle, while advanced personalization, multimodal learning, voice interaction, gamification, and teacher-oriented capabilities can be developed in later phases.
This requirement analysis can directly serve as the foundation for the next phase: System Design / Architecture, where these requirements are converted into modules, database design, API flow, UI screens, and the Gemini integration architecture.
